{
  "name": "happy",
  "integration": "foreman",
  "description": "One bulk fact_values walk plus one host page, with the per-host interface fetch enabled. Proves the facts are indexed by host NAME and joined back onto the host record; that networking::interfaces::<device>::<mac|ip> facts are unflattened into per-NIC interfaces; that the lo device and the all-zero MAC are dropped; that a bond and its slave sharing one MAC are folded into a single interface rather than emitted twice; that the BMC interface is NOT folded into the host (it is given a 169.254.100.1 address, so a leak would trip the no_loopback_interfaces invariant); that a host with no interface facts still gets an interface from the host record's own ip/mac; that a host whose only address is 127.0.0.1 yields an asset with NO interface; and that a host record with no id is skipped with a log line.",
